# Module name

Write the module description here. Everything in this file appears at the top of
the generated `README.md`.

`README.md` itself is generated by terraform-docs and any edit to it is
overwritten. Edit this file or `_footer.md` instead.

## Usage

```hcl
module "example" {
  source = "github.com/Coalfire-CF/<repo>?ref=vX.Y.Z"
}
```
